Package: s7x
Title: Extensions to the 'S7' Object System
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Josiah", "Parry", , "josiah.parry@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9910-865X"))
Description: Provides utilities that extend the 'S7' object system:
    enumerated types with a fixed set of variants, scalar-constrained
    properties, range-bound numeric properties, and property-level unions
    and intersections. These building blocks make it possible to express
    precise, type-safe class properties in 'S7' with less boilerplate.
